            </div>
            <div class="lg:justify-self-end">
              <p class="section-copy">勾選後會自動儲存在目前瀏覽器的 localStorage，不需登入、不上傳伺服器。換瀏覽器或清除網站資料後，清單會重設。</p>
              <button id="clearPlan" class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold text-[#d3ad70] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-4" type="button">清空本機清單</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" id="planList">
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="moon-heart" /><span><strong class="text-white">月影潭心</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">看結構、走進作品、拍夜間光影。</small></span></label>
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="fountain" /><span><strong class="text-white">蘭潭音樂噴泉</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">到場前先確認當晚場次與維護公告。</small></span></label>
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="lake-walk" /><span><strong class="text-white">湖畔散步</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">安排日落前的湖風與觀景時間。</small></span></label>
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="back-trail" /><span><strong class="text-white">蘭潭後山步道</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">適合白天健行，雨後注意泥濘。</small></span></label>
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="chiayi-park" /><span><strong class="text-white">嘉義公園與射日塔</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">可與蘭潭串成城市東側半日線。</small></span></label>
            <label class="check-card"><input type="checkbox" data-plan-id="food" /><span><strong class="text-white">嘉義小吃</strong><small class="mt-1 block leading-6 text-white/55">火雞肉飯、涼麵與文化路夜市擇一。</small></span></label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="gallery" class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="gallery-title">
        <div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-end">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">PHOTO WALL</div>
            <h2 id="gallery-title" class="section-title">蘭潭不是一種藍</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-copy lg:justify-self-end">點擊照片可放大。所有圖片已下載到專案並轉為 WebP，不在訪客瀏覽時調用第三方圖床。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-grid">
          {gallery.map((image) => (
            <button class="gallery-item" type="button" data-gallery-src={image.src} data-gallery-alt={image.alt} data-gallery-title={image.title} aria-label={`放大照片：${image.title}`}>
              <img src={image.src} alt={image.alt} width={image.width} height={image.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <span class="gallery-caption"><strong class="display-serif text-xl">{image.title}</strong><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <dialog id="lightbox" class="lightbox" aria-labelledby="lightboxTitle">
        <div class="relative">
          <img id="lightboxImage" src="/images/moonheart-main.webp" alt="" />
          <button id="lightboxClose" class="absolute right-4 top-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-black/65 text-2xl text-white" type="button" aria-label="關閉照片">×</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4 md:p-5">
          <p id="lightboxTitle" class="display-serif text-lg text-white"></p>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] text-white/45">ESC 關閉</span>
        </div>
      </dialog>

      <section id="food" class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[#0b1f19] py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="food-title">
        <div class="site-shell">
          <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">NEARBY FOOD</div>
              <h2 id="food-title" class="section-title">周邊美食，留給嘉義的味道</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-copy lg:justify-self-end">湖區本身不是密集商圈，最穩妥的安排是先在市區吃，或看完夜景後回到文化路一帶。以下以品類規劃，不綁定容易變動的店家營業時間。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-12 grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <article class="food-card"><div class="text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d3ad70]">CHIAYI CLASSIC</div><h3 class="display-serif mt-3 text-2xl text-white">火雞肉飯</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">適合在進蘭潭前解決正餐。市區選擇多，可按排隊時間與停車便利度決定。</p></article>
            <article class="food-card"><div class="text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d3ad70]">LOCAL TEXTURE</div><h3 class="display-serif mt-3 text-2xl text-white">嘉義涼麵</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">以寬麵、白醋或美乃滋風味形成獨特地方吃法，適合白天行程。</p></article>
            <article class="food-card"><div class="text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d3ad70]">NIGHT MARKET</div><h3 class="display-serif mt-3 text-2xl text-white">文化路夜市</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">看完點燈後回市區吃小吃，路線直觀，也能把甜點與宵夜一次排入。</p></article>
            <article class="food-card"><div class="text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d3ad70]">PICNIC IDEA</div><h3 class="display-serif mt-3 text-2xl text-white">簡單野餐</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">可先在市區準備飲品與輕食，垃圾自行帶走；作品與步道周邊不生火。</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="nearby" class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="nearby-title">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">AROUND LANTAN</div>
            <h2 id="nearby-title" class="section-title">月影潭心周邊地標與景點</h2>
            <p class="section-copy mt-6">不要把月影潭心當成孤立打卡點。它更適合成為嘉義東側自然與城市文化路線的最後一站，周邊包含{nearbyLandmark1}與{nearbyLandmark2}等可串聯的地標。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <article class="info-card"><div class="info-label">湖畔</div><h3 class="info-value">蘭潭音樂噴泉</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">與月影潭心相鄰，適合在同一時段等候夜間水景；場次先查官方公告。</p></article>
            <article class="info-card"><div class="info-label">自然</div><h3 class="info-value">蘭潭後山步道</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">林蔭、坡道與城市近郊視野兼具，建議白天前往並準備飲水。</p></article>
            <article class="info-card"><div class="info-label">城市綠地</div><h3 class="info-value">嘉義公園・射日塔</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">可先逛嘉義公園，再向東前往蘭潭，將城市歷史與湖景排在一起。</p></article>
            <article class="info-card"><div class="info-label">木造街區</div><h3 class="info-value">檜意森活村</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/60">適合上午或午後拍木造建築，傍晚再移動到月影潭心看點燈。</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="card-maker" class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[#10251f] py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="card-title">
        <div class="site-shell">
          <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-end">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">SOUVENIR CARD</div>
              <h2 id="card-title" class="section-title">把你看到的光，做成景點紀念卡</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-white/65">
              <strong class="text-white">照片僅保存在您的裝置。</strong> 選圖、拍照、文字與成品皆在瀏覽器本地 Canvas 處理，不上傳、不經伺服器。關閉頁面後，未下載的成品不會由本站保存。
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]">
            <form id="cardForm" class="glass-panel h-fit rounded-[1.5rem] p-5 md:p-7" novalidate>
              <div class="grid gap-5">
                <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="form-field">
                    <label for="photoInput">拍照 / 從相簿選圖</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="photoInput" name="photo" type="file" accept="image/*" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-field">
                    <label for="selfieInput">自拍</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="selfieInput" name="selfie" type="file" accept="image/*" capture="user" />
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="form-field">
                    <label for="cardSize">尺寸</label>
                    <select class="form-control" id="cardSize" name="size">
                      <option value="square">1:1 方形</option>
                      <option value="postcard">明信片直式</option>
                      <option value="story">9:16 直式</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-field">
                    <label for="cardStyle">風格</label>
                    <select class="form-control" id="cardStyle" name="style">
                      <option value="moon">月光墨綠</option>
                      <option value="silver">霧銀編織</option>
                      <option value="gold">暖金夕照</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-field">
                  <label for="cardPlace">景點名</label>
                  <input class="form-control" id="cardPlace" name="place" type="text" maxlength="24" value="蘭潭月影潭心" />
                </div>
                <div class="form-field">
                  <label for="cardDate">日期文字</label>
                  <input class="form-control" id="cardDate" name="date" type="text" maxlength="28" />
                </div>
                <div class="form-field">
                  <label for="cardNote">短句</label>
                  <input class="form-control" id="cardNote" name="note" type="text" maxlength="40" value="月、水與一段慢下來的路" />
                </div>
                <button id="downloadCard" class="primary-button mt-2 w-full" type="button">下載 PNG 紀念卡</button>
                <p id="cardStatus" class="min-h-6 text-center text-sm text-[#d3ad70]" aria-live="polite"></p>
              </div>
            </form>
            <div class="card-stage">
              <canvas id="souvenirCanvas" width="1200" height="1200" aria-label="紀念卡預覽"></canvas>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="responsibility" class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="responsibility-title">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">CONSERVATION</div>
            <h2 id="responsibility-title" class="section-title">湖岸保育與訪客責任</h2>
            <p class="section-copy mt-6">蘭潭是嘉義重要的水源與生態場域。把這片水域留給下一代，靠的是每位訪客的小動作。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <article class="prose-block">
              <h3 class="display-serif text-2xl text-white">守住水源與生態</h3>
              <p class="section-copy mt-3">請勿戲水、垂釣或丟棄垃圾，所有垃圾自行帶走；避免驚擾水鳥與其他野生動物，讓蘭潭維持它應有的清澈與安靜。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="prose-block">
              <h3 class="display-serif text-2xl text-white">愛護公共藝術</h3>
              <p class="section-copy mt-3">月影潭心以鋁編構成，請不攀爬、不塗鴉、不觸碰結構外緣；與作品保持安全距離，也能看見更完整的光影。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="prose-block">
              <h3 class="display-serif text-2xl text-white">與天氣和鄰里共處</h3>
              <p class="section-copy mt-3">颱風、強風、暴雨期間避免前往；夜間降低音量，不開強光直射居民與動物。出發前查看即時天氣與官方公告，是對自己與環境都負責的做法。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="prose-block">
              <h3 class="display-serif text-2xl text-white">一點科普</h3>
              <p class="section-copy mt-3">蘭潭做為城市供水的水庫，其水質與水位受降雨與集水區管理影響；湖域為底棲生物、水鳥與周邊林相提供棲地。認識這層關係，會讓「來看一眼月光」更有分量。</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="faq" class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.68fr_1.32fr]">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
            <h2 id="faq-title" class="section-title">常見問答</h2>
            <p class="section-copy mt-6">景點為開放式公共空間；遇到維護、極端天氣或活動管制時，以現場及嘉義市官方資訊為準。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            {faqs.map((faq) => (
              <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
                <p>{faq.answer}</p>
              </details>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

